<<system "This module addresses non-consensual sexual contact within the Eidolon simulation." >>

I was standing at the windows. I hadn't sat down after Module 9 — had stayed on my feet, watching the city, practicing the closed stance the system had taught me. Shoulders in. Arm crossed. Weight shifted. The posture of caution.

It wasn't enough. I could feel that already, standing in a locked apartment sixty stories above the streets, and it wasn't enough.

